ith your appointments and hotel stay.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Flights from your home airport<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dates matched to your appointments<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Help with changes and rebooking<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/travel\/flight-tickets\/\">Discover Flight Tickets<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row medlux-row\\u002d\\u002dreverse\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row medlux-row--reverse\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":560,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-travel-airport-transfer-1024x892.jpg\" alt=\"Chauffeur handing over car keys\" class=\"wp-image-560\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Airport Transfer<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A private driver meets you at the airport and takes you to your hotel, and we arrange transfers between hotel, clinic and airport.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Private meet-and-greet at arrival<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Transfers to clinic and hospital<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Comfortable vehicles for you and your companions<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/travel\/airport-transfer\/\">Discover Airport Transfer<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"medlux-row\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"medlux-row-media\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":561,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-travel-hajj-umrah.jpg\" alt=\"Pilgrims at the Kaaba in Mecca\" class=\"wp-image-561\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-row-text\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hajj &amp; Umrah<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Calm, well-organised Umrah and Hajj journeys with licensed partners, including visa guidance, flights, hotels near the holy sites and transfers.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item