-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Airport Transfer<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A private driver meets you at the airport and takes you to your hotel, and we arrange transfers between hotel, clinic and airport.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Private meet-and-greet at arrival<\/li>\n\n<li>Transfers to clinic and hospital<\/li>\n\n<li>Comfortable vehicles for you and your companions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/travel\/airport-transfer\/\">Discover Airport Transfer<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns medlux-row is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column medlux-row-media is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-row-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"360\" height=\"189\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-travel-hajj-umrah.jpg\" alt=\"Pilgrims at the Kaaba in Mecca\" class=\"wp-image-561\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-travel-hajj-umrah.jpg 360w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-travel-hajj-umrah-300x158.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-travel-hajj-umrah-18x9.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center medlux-row-text is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-f