ings and send you all travel documents.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Support during your trip<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are available for you before and during your journey.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your journey with us<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tell us what you have in mind and we will prepare a personal, no-obligation offer for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/contact\/\">Request an Offer<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false,"block_version":1},"excerpt":{"raw":"","rendered":"<p>Whether you combine your treatment with a few days of rest or travel purely for pleasure or pilgrimage, MedLuxLife takes care of the details: holidays, hotels, flights, airport transfers and Hajj and Umrah journeys, all planned around you. Our travel services Holiday Packages Relax before or after your treatment, or simply enjoy a holiday: tailor-made [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":3,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-with-title","meta":{"footnotes":""},"permalink_template":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/%pagename%\/","generated_slug":"travel","class_list":["post-25","page","type-page